  ('62a8d706-186d-52f7-9d6d-ba80fc5957c0', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'vanquis-purchase', 'Vanquis Purchase Credit Card', 'Vanquis Bank Limited', 'Not stated', 'GB', 'GBP', 'cashback', 0, null, null, 'Catalogued for identification; reward comparison pending', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://www.vanquis.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/PD12608-0925_Generic-AB_CC_Standard_Terms-I-v1.pdf', 'catalog_only', '2026-09-28', 'The purchase offer and APR are personalised, and selected-retailer cashback lacks stable published earning rules. 1 introductory or account-specific promotion was recorded in research but excluded from ongoing checkout ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#173f3a', '#2f7467', '#c8ff62', true, false),
  ('d9403e0e-d220-541b-89ac-d9b6024daddf', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'vanquis-travel', 'Vanquis Travel Credit Card', 'Vanquis Bank Limited', 'Visa', 'GB', 'GBP', 'cashback', 0, null, null, 'No ongoing purchase rewards', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://www.vanquis.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/PD12608-0925_Generic-AB_CC_Standard_Terms-I-v1.pdf', 'verified', '2026-09-28', 'Zero foreign transaction fees applies to overseas purchase and cash transactions, but cash-withdrawal fees of up to 5% or £3 may still apply. SmartDelay and AirRefund are third-party benefits that may change. Published foreign-purchase fee: 0%. FX costs are not yet included in ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#173f3a', '#2f7467', '#c8ff62', true, false),
  ('136439d5-90d5-5e8c-ba1b-2753d27688e2', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'virgin-money-uk-virgin-atlantic-reward', 'Virgin Atlantic Reward Credit Card', 'Virgin Money', 'Mastercard', 'GB', 'GBP', 'cashback', 0, null, 0, 'Catalogued for identification; reward comparison pending', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://uk.virginmoney.com/virgin/assets/pdf/VM48925.pdf', 'catalog_only', '2026-09-28', 'Virgin Points and the annual reward voucher do not have a single official fixed monetary value. Reward-voucher value depends on Flying Club tier and redemption. 2 introductory or account-specific promotions were recorded in research but excluded from ongoing checkout ranking. Published foreign-purchase fee: 2.99%. FX costs are not yet included in ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#3f311d', '#8c6a32', '#ffe2a1', true, false),
  ('1aad5d6d-5bd7-592c-8b42-740ee38833ee', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'virgin-money-uk-virgin-atlantic-reward-plus', 'Virgin Atlantic Reward+ Credit Card', 'Virgin Money', 'Mastercard', 'GB', 'GBP', 'cashback', 0, null, 16000, 'Catalogued for identification; reward comparison pending', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://uk.virginmoney.com/virgin/assets/pdf/VM48924.pdf', 'catalog_only', '2026-09-28', 'Virgin Points and the annual reward voucher do not have a single official fixed monetary value. Reward-voucher value depends on Flying Club tier and redemption. 2 introductory or account-specific promotions were recorded in research but excluded from ongoing checkout ranking. Published foreign-purchase fee: 2.99%. FX costs are not yet included in ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#3f311d', '#8c6a32', '#ffe2a1', true, false),
  ('9f401f1b-564c-565e-8208-cad2b28ab8f6', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'virgin-money-uk-everyday-cashback', 'Virgin Money Everyday Cashback Credit Card', 'Virgin Money', 'Mastercard', 'GB', 'GBP', 'cashback', 0, null, 0, 'Catalogued for identification; reward comparison pending', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://uk.virginmoney.com/cards/terms/everyday-cashback-card-terms/', 'catalog_only', '2026-09-28', 'The ongoing reward is direct cashback and the monthly cap is explicit. 1 introductory or account-specific promotion was recorded in research but excluded from ongoing checkout ranking. Published foreign-purchase fee: 0%. FX costs are not yet included in ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#3f311d', '#8c6a32', '#ffe2a1', true, false),
  ('ca56af0c-c507-5dff-b442-a6e899f54f94', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'yonder-free-credit', 'Yonder Free Credit Card', 'Yonder Technology Ltd', 'Mastercard', 'GB', 'GBP', 'cashback', 0, null, 0, 'Catalogued for identification; reward comparison pending', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://www.yonder.com/docs/uk-rewards-terms-conditions-2-2', 'catalog_only', '2026-09-28', 'Free members cannot redeem points for the fixed cash-equivalent credit described in the rewards terms. Experience redemption cost and value vary in-app, so a universal cash value must not be assigned. 2 introductory or account-specific promotions were recorded in research but excluded from ongoing checkout ranking. Published foreign-purchase fee: 0%. FX costs are not yet included in ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#1f3154', '#496aa3', '#d7e8ff', true, false),
  ('be5485c2-7a4d-5ca0-90a8-f2c004745ffc', '8a8ecadf-144e-525c-b0bc-24303c52f64a', 'yonder-premium-credit', 'Yonder Premium Credit Card', 'Yonder Technology Ltd', 'Mastercard', 'GB', 'GBP', 'points', 5, 0.1, 19000, 'Yonder Premium account-credit floor', 'Official issuer material checked 2026-09-28', 'https://www.yonder.com/docs/uk-rewards-terms-conditions-2-2', 'verified', '2026-09-28', 'Yonder has both older ''Full'' pages/agreements quoting £15 monthly or £160 annually and current ''Premium'' pages quoting £17.99 monthly or £190 annually. This record follows the current Premium product page. Experience redemption can produce higher value (marketed as up to 2.5% return), but it varies by reward. The rankable floor uses the official fixed cash-equivalent credit only. 3 introductory or account-specific promotions were recorded in research but excluded from ongoing checkout ranking. Published foreign-purchase fee: 0%. FX costs are not yet included in ranking.', '2026-09-28', '#1f3154', '#496aa3', '#d7e8ff', true, false)
